WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.041
Because no matter
how much I hate him, or you,

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:07.583
what I saw in that cave, felt in my guts,

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.916
I know the demon is worse.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.916
Terrorblade is worse.

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:16.958
Now please, let's fix this
before anyone else dies.

00:00:17.041 --> 00:00:18.625
[Slyrak growling]

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:27.875
What is your judgment?

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:30.083
Let Slyrak be reborn,

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:32.750
and he can tell us of this demon himself.

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:35.000
He can share his plan.

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:38.583
-Wait. What?
-Destroy the body. Release the soul.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.708
[grunting]

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:50.208
The human must die that Slyrak may return.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:55.166
Let the Thunder sing as one voice.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.416
[epic music]

00:01:00.708 --> 00:01:02.541
[grunting]

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:10.208
Kill the little mouse. Eat it.

00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:14.333
[groaning]
Mirana.

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:16.333
-[Davion] She's…
-[grunts]

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:19.375
He's killing her. Fucking do it!

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:22.000
Kill me before Slyrak kills her!

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:32.375
[Mirana panting, grunting]

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:38.083
[Mirana breathing heavily]

00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:44.791
Come on.

00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:47.500
I can feel you in there, Davion.

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:51.041
I know you have the strength.

00:01:51.125 --> 00:01:53.416
I know you can take control.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.500
[roars]

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:05.291
Davion!

00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:10.291
Mirana.

00:02:11.416 --> 00:02:14.041
You slay monsters, not people.

00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:26.291
Death.

00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:29.458
No.

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:33.208
[thunder rumbles]

00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:37.708
[groans]

00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:41.166
[grunting, groaning]

00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:44.916
[screaming]

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.333
[roaring]

00:02:50.416 --> 00:02:51.791
Davion…

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:55.375
[crash]

00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:02.458
[exhales sharply]

